flowchart TD
    A[User opens Project Page] --> B[Clicks 'Export Documentation']
    B --> C[Export Modal Opens]
    C --> D{Features with content?}
    D -->|No| E[Show 'No exportable features' message]
    D -->|Yes| F[Display feature tree with checkboxes]
    F --> G[User expands features to see diagrams]
    G --> H[User checks/unchecks individual diagrams]
    H --> I{At least one item selected?}
    I -->|No| J[Download button disabled]
    J --> H
    I -->|Yes| K[Download button enabled]
    K --> L[User clicks Download]
    L --> M[Loading spinner shown]
    M --> N[Server generates HTML]
    N --> O{Generation successful?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Browser downloads HTML file]
    O -->|No| Q[Toast error notification]
    P --> R[User opens HTML on any device]
    R --> S[Diagrams render via Mermaid CDN]
    S --> T[User navigates diagrams via card gallery]
    T --> U[Click card to expand in modal]
